#. (itstool) path: component/name
#: org.kde.kbibtex.appdata.xml:17
msgid "KBibTeX"
msgstr "KBibTeX"

#. (itstool) path: component/summary
#: org.kde.kbibtex.appdata.xml:18
msgid "BibTeX editor by KDE to edit bibliographies used with LaTeX"
msgstr ""
"BibTeX editor oleh KDE untuk mengedit bibliografis yang digunakan "
"menggunakan LaTeX"

#. (itstool) path: description/p
#: org.kde.kbibtex.appdata.xml:20
msgid ""
"KBibTeX is a reference management application which can be used to collect "
"TeX/LaTeX bibliographies and export them in various formats."
msgstr ""
"KBibTeX adalah sebuah aplikasi pengelolaan yang disukai yang mana bisa "
"digunakan untuk mengoleksi bibliografis TeX/LaTeX dan mengekspornya dalam "
"berbagai format."

#. (itstool) path: description/p
#: org.kde.kbibtex.appdata.xml:23
msgid "KBibTeX can do the following things:"
msgstr "KBibTeX bisa melakukan hal-hal berikut ini:"

#. (itstool) path: ul/li
#: org.kde.kbibtex.appdata.xml:25
msgid ""
"Preview bibliography entries in various formats (Source (BibTeX), Source "
"(RIS), Wikipedia, standard (XML/XSLT), fancy (XML/XSLT), and abstract-only "
"(XML/XSLT)). Additional preview styles become available when bibtex2html is "
"installed."
msgstr ""
"Mempratinjau entry-entry bibliografi dalam beberapa format (Source (BibTeX), "
"Source (RIS), Wikipedia, (XML/XSLT) standar, (XML/XSLT) fancy, dan (XML/"
"XSLT) hanya-abstrak). Gaya pratinjau tambahan menjadi tersedia ketika "
"bibtex2html telah terinstal."

#. (itstool) path: ul/li
#: org.kde.kbibtex.appdata.xml:26
msgid ""
"Import data in various bibliography file formats such as BibTeX, RIS and ISI "
"(requires bibutils) and export data to PDF (requires pdflatex), PostScript "
"(requires latex), RTF (requires latex2rtf), and HTML."
msgstr ""
"Mengimpor data dalam beberapa format file bibliografi sepertihalnya BibTeX  "
"RIS dan ISI (diperlukan bibutils) dan data expor ke PDF (diperlukan "
"pdflatex), PostScript (diperlukan latex), RTF (diperlukan latex2rtf), dan "
"HTML."

#. (itstool) path: ul/li
#: org.kde.kbibtex.appdata.xml:27
msgid ""
"Search for the bibliography entries data in online databases (e.g. Google "
"Scholar, ACM, IEEE, arXiv, etc.)"
msgstr ""
"Pencarian untuk entri data bibliografi dalam database online (misal Google "
"Scholar, ACM, IEEE, arXiv, dll.)"

#. (itstool) path: ul/li
#: org.kde.kbibtex.appdata.xml:28
msgid ""
"Preview local or remote (online) resources, e.g. PDF files, linked in the "
"BibTEX entry."
msgstr ""
"Mempratinjau sumberdaya lokal atau jarak jauh, misalnya file PDF, tertaut "
"dalam entri BibTEX."

#. (itstool) path: ul/li
#: org.kde.kbibtex.appdata.xml:29
msgid "Find and merge duplicate entries in bibliography."
msgstr "Menemukan dan menggabungkan entri-entri duplikat dalam bibliografi."

#. (itstool) path: ul/li
#: org.kde.kbibtex.appdata.xml:30
msgid "Integrate your bibliographies with LaTeX editors such as Kile and LyX."
msgstr ""
"Mengintegrasikan bibliografismu dengan editor LaTeX sepertihalnya Kile dan "
"LyX."

#. (itstool) path: ul/li
#: org.kde.kbibtex.appdata.xml:31
msgid "Import your Zotero library."
msgstr "Impor pustaka Zotero-mu."

#. (itstool) path: screenshot/caption
#: org.kde.kbibtex.appdata.xml:39
msgid "KBibTeX main window"
msgstr "Jendela utama KBibTeX"
